{"identifier":"Automoti1940","title":"Automotive Service","description":"Opportunities for employment servicing America's vast motor fleet.","videoUrl":"https://archive.org/download/Automoti1940/Automoti1940_512kb.mp4","thumbnailUrl":"https://archive.org/services/img/Automoti1940","sourcePageUrl":"https://archive.org/details/Automoti1940","durationMs":593000,"level":"B2","topic":"Occupations: Automotive;Car culture: General;Automobiles: Service and repair","sourceCredit":"Source: Internet Archive — Automotive Service","hasCaptions":true,"segments":[{"startMs":0,"endMs":1001,"text":"Your life worked."},{"startMs":4000,"endMs":13001,"text":"Music Not so"},{"startMs":13001,"endMs":16001,"text":"many years ago, the automobile was considered a luxury."},{"startMs":17001,"endMs":21000,"text":"About the only time it received an airing was on Sunday or a holiday."},{"startMs":22000,"endMs":26001,"text":"Today, millions of buses, trucks, and cars travel the highways from coast to coast."},{"startMs":27000,"endMs":35001,"text":"The number of cars on our city streets offers proof that for millions of people, automotive transportation is almost as much a necessity as a house."},{"startMs":37001,"endMs":41001,"text":"The good, all-round service man is really four mechanics in one."},{"startMs":42000,"endMs":47000,"text":"He must be able to make all repairs on the engine, such as repairing or replacing the camshaft."},{"startMs":48000,"endMs":50001,"text":"He must understand all types of engines thoroughly."},{"startMs":51000,"endMs":58001,"text":"Or although all gas engines are fundamentally the same, differences have been developed in the various makes of cars, which the mechanic must know."},{"startMs":60000,"endMs":69000,"text":"For example, in cleaning out carbon and grinding valves, he may work on the L -head type engine one time, while the next engine may be the overhead valve type."},{"startMs":69001,"endMs":74001,"text":"Both types provide efficient power, but the problems of adjusting them are totally different."},{"startMs":77001,"endMs":80000,"text":"A good service man is also a machinist."},{"startMs":80000,"endMs":87000,"text":"In an emergency, he may be called upon to make completely some minor part, which may not be in the stock of repair parts."},{"startMs":89000,"endMs":91000,"text":"The superior service man is a welder."},{"startMs":91001,"endMs":96000,"text":"Through accidents and even ordinary usage, parts are broken and have to be repaired."},{"startMs":96001,"endMs":103000,"text":"The expert welder is valuable to any garage, and often concentrates on specialized work at very good pay."},{"startMs":104001,"endMs":112001,"text":"In addition, the all-round service man is an electrician, and must have the knowledge and skill to keep the automobile's electrical system in working order."},{"startMs":113001,"endMs":116001,"text":"So without the spark to fire the engine, there would be no power."},{"startMs":117000,"endMs":124001,"text":"In the early days, electrical energy was supplied by dry batteries, but the car of today carries its own generating and storage plant."},{"startMs":125001,"endMs":133000,"text":"The storage battery is of low voltage, so a coil-in condenser is necessary to step up the current enough to jump the spark gaps and the spark floods."},{"startMs":134000,"endMs":138000,"text":"The coil-in distributor also must be tested and kept in proper working order."},{"startMs":139000,"endMs":145001,"text":"Besides the ignition system, there are the lighting and starting circuits which sometimes need the services of a competent mechanic."},{"startMs":146000,"endMs":152001,"text":"The use of heaters, windshield wipers, and radios has further increased and complicated the electrical work of the service man."},{"startMs":154000,"endMs":161001,"text":"Because of the high speed at which vehicles travel today, the care and adjustment of brakes is a serious and vital part of the service man's work."},{"startMs":162000,"endMs":168001,"text":"The safety of the car on the highway largely depends on good brakes, along with correct and accurate alignment of the wheels."},{"startMs":171001,"endMs":180000,"text":"Radiator repair and general care of the cooling system is important in making cars run efficiently and economically, so soldering is another of the many kinds"},{"startMs":180000,"endMs":182001,"text":"of work the service man must do."},{"startMs":188001,"endMs":195000,"text":"In the larger garages, the man who becomes expert in servicing engines may find specialized work on engines only."},{"startMs":196000,"endMs":199001,"text":"There are body and fender shops which employ men who are specialists in that land."},{"startMs":200000,"endMs":206000,"text":"There are battery and electrical shops, and other shops which make brake testing and wheel aligning the principal part of their business."},{"startMs":207000,"endMs":211000,"text":"For any of these jobs, a thorough training and general service work is valuable."},{"startMs":212000,"endMs":219000,"text":"There is an opportunity in the larger garages for the service man to advance to service manager or to become a troubleshooter."},{"startMs":219001,"endMs":228001,"text":"Besides technical knowledge and skills, these jobs require the ability to meet the public, to make a good impression, and to explain clearly the work that needs"},{"startMs":228001,"endMs":230001,"text":"to be done or that has been done."},{"startMs":231001,"endMs":233001,"text":"Some service men become automobile salesmen."},{"startMs":234000,"endMs":241000,"text":"If they have sales ability, they are usually successful, because they have the advantage of really understanding the cars they sell."},{"startMs":244001,"endMs":253000,"text":"If you enter the automotive service field, your first job will probably be as a helper in the shop of a general service garage,"},{"startMs":253001,"endMs":255001,"text":"or it may be in the parts department."},{"startMs":256001,"endMs":262000,"text":"You will have a chance to learn the names of the many parts of an automobile and their relationship to each other."},{"startMs":263001,"endMs":267001,"text":"You will learn about lubrication and other operations in automobile upkeep."},{"startMs":268000,"endMs":272001,"text":"While doing these jobs, you must be alert to learn everything you possibly can."},{"startMs":273000,"endMs":276000,"text":"You must also study constantly in your spare time."},{"startMs":277001,"endMs":285001,"text":"As a basis for study, there are numerous service manuals put out by the automobile manufacturers to help train service men to do their work correctly."},{"startMs":286000,"endMs":293000,"text":"These manuals are full of accurate information, and they're interesting to study because of their detailed diagrams and illustrations."},{"startMs":294000,"endMs":297001,"text":"There are many good books on automotive service in your school or public library."},{"startMs":298001,"endMs":304000,"text":"Be sure to select books which are up to date, however, as automobiles are constantly being improved."},{"startMs":305001,"endMs":309001,"text":"Most automobile manufacturers provide training courses for their service men."},{"startMs":310001,"endMs":314001,"text":"Regular training conferences are held for employees in the more up-to-date garages."},{"startMs":315000,"endMs":322000,"text":"The manager, shop foreman, or some other expert, discusses the newest automobile developments and how to service them properly."},{"startMs":323001,"endMs":326000,"text":"Movies and slide films are sometimes shown in the local shop."},{"startMs":327000,"endMs":329001,"text":"Manuals for further study are provided along with the films."},{"startMs":330001,"endMs":336000,"text":"You should never miss such opportunities to learn if you expect to become a successful mechanic."},{"startMs":337001,"endMs":344000,"text":"Another way to learn while working is to attend evening classes dealing with the fundamental principles of the automobile."},{"startMs":345000,"endMs":350001,"text":"These classes are conducted in the larger towns and cities by the public schools or other local organizations."},{"startMs":351001,"endMs":354000,"text":"In some of them, courses in shop practice are also given."},{"startMs":355000,"endMs":360000,"text":"Don't fail to take advantage of these courses to help you prepare yourself for the better jobs."},{"startMs":362001,"endMs":369001,"text":"There are a number of private automotive trade schools which offer good courses, but some of them have practical equipment such as this"},{"startMs":369001,"endMs":371000,"text":"cutaway duplicate of a differential."},{"startMs":372000,"endMs":376000,"text":"You should never choose such a school, however, without thorough investigation."},{"startMs":377000,"endMs":384000,"text":"Ask your teachers or other authorities about them, or you can take a correspondence course, which also should be investigated."},{"startMs":385000,"endMs":394000,"text":"A correspondence course will be most valuable to you after you actually start working, for theory and practice carried on together will"},{"startMs":394000,"endMs":395001,"text":"give you the most thorough training."},{"startMs":396001,"endMs":405000,"text":"However you get your training, study and hard work are necessary for you to become a superior mechanic, able to hold one of the better jobs."},{"startMs":412000,"endMs":416001,"text":"While you're still in high school, you can lay a strong foundation for automotive service."},{"startMs":417001,"endMs":422001,"text":"The gas engine produces power by burning fuel in a small enclosed space."},{"startMs":423000,"endMs":425000,"text":"In your physics class, you'll learn how this is done."},{"startMs":429000,"endMs":437000,"text":"In physics, you'll learn how the cooling system carries off the heat after power has been produced by the burning or combustion process in the engine."},{"startMs":439000,"endMs":447001,"text":"The transmission of the engine's power through gears and wheels to make the car move can be more clearly understood if you know the principles of physics."},{"startMs":451000,"endMs":454000,"text":"Electrical physics will help you understand the ignition of a car."},{"startMs":454001,"endMs":462000,"text":"So you can see that physics is not only an interesting subject, but very necessary if you were to become a first class auto mechanic."},{"startMs":465001,"endMs":470001,"text":"Take all the mathematics you can, for you'll need it in every type of automotive work you do."},{"startMs":473001,"endMs":480000,"text":"Mechanical drawing will help you in reading the many plans and illustrations in automotive textbooks and service manuals."},{"startMs":480000,"endMs":483001,"text":"This is especially important if you plan to become a shop foreman."},{"startMs":486000,"endMs":491001,"text":"In some of the larger public schools, the school shop is equipped to give practical automotive training."},{"startMs":492001,"endMs":499000,"text":"In others, this experience must be found in a service garage at the same time that automotive theory is studied in schools."},{"startMs":500000,"endMs":510000,"text":"School shop training of any kind will help you develop the coordination of hands and mind which is so important in all mechanical work."},{"startMs":512000,"endMs":519000,"text":"As an automobile service worker, you will have a responsibility for the safe,"},{"startMs":519001,"endMs":522001,"text":"smooth, and economical operation of the cars on which you work."},{"startMs":523000,"endMs":530001,"text":"No matter what the size of the shop, there is one rule for success. Every job must be done right."},{"startMs":532000,"endMs":539001,"text":"If you develop the ability to manage a business, you may be promoted to garage manager, or you may be able to go into business for yourself."},{"startMs":540001,"endMs":546000,"text":"For this, you'll need to know something about bookkeeping, salesmanship, and business management."},{"startMs":548001,"endMs":555001,"text":"If you really like to use tools and have a knack for mechanical work, learn all you can about it at your local service garage."},{"startMs":556001,"endMs":560001,"text":"You'll find some things you may not like, but the dirt and grease will wash off."},{"startMs":563000,"endMs":570001,"text":"Try tinkering with an old car and rebuilding it. Do the best job you can, just as though some car owner depended on you."},{"startMs":571000,"endMs":574000,"text":"When you're finished, you may have found your life work."},{"startMs":575000,"endMs":584000,"text":"Thousands of new automobiles are manufactured every year. Although many of them replace cars which are worn out, the total number of motor vehicles will probably"},{"startMs":584000,"endMs":586001,"text":"continue to increase for some time to come."},{"startMs":587000,"endMs":593000,"text":"If you qualify yourself, there is a reasonable possibility that you will find employment in the automotive service field."}]}